development.question_text:
The ogive shows the daily commute times of $80$ workers.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.85]
\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,6.0);
\draw[->] (0,0) -- (6.5,0);
\foreach \y in {20,40,60,80} {\draw (-0.15,\y/16) -- (0,\y/16); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y/16) {$\y$};}
\node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
\foreach \x/\val in {1/10,2/20,3/30,4/40,5/50} {\draw (\x,0) -- (\x,-0.12); \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,-0.12) {$\val$};}
\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (1,0.75) -- (2,2.0) -- (3,3.75) -- (4,4.625) -- (5,5.0);
\foreach \p in {(0,0),(1,0.75),(2,2.0),(3,3.75),(4,4.625),(5,5.0)} {\fill \p circle (2.5pt);}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,2.5) {Cumulative frequency};
\node[below] at (2.5,-1.0) {Time (minutes)};
\node at (2.5,5.8) {Commute times};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Estimate the median commute time.

The ogive shows the distribution of exam marks for $80$ students.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.85]
\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,5.8);
\draw[->] (0,0) -- (6.5,0);
\foreach \y in {20,40,60,80} {\draw (-0.15,\y/16) -- (0,\y/16); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y/16) {$\y$};}
\node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$};
\foreach \x/\val in {1/20,2/40,3/60,4/80,5/100} {\draw (\x,0) -- (\x,-0.12); \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,-0.12) {$\val$};}
